# UAV_5GSim evidence policy
#
# Both supplied UAS documents require the raw simulation evidence to be
# delivered alongside the dataset. Everything the documents name as a
# deliverable is tracked here: scenario manifests, Simu5G scalar results
# (.sca), OMNeT++/Simu5G run configuration, ROS bag metadata, pose and
# mobility traces, bridge logs, per-run 44-column datasets, validator output,
# provenance and leakage audits.
#
# Only the bulk regenerable simulator dumps are excluded, because they are
# large binaries that Git cannot delta-compress and that any reviewer can
# rebuild from the tracked manifests and configuration:
#
#   Simu5G vector output        ~1.5 GB
#   raw per-flow metric dumps   ~654 MB
#   ROS 2 .mcap bag payloads    ~54 MB
#
# Their SHA-256 checksums, sizes and source runs are recorded in
# experiments/reports/raw_evidence_manifest.json so the delivered archive
# remains verifiable without them.

# Python caches
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Interactive runtime scratch written by UAV_5GSim.ipynb and run_uav_gazebo.py
/notebook_runs/
/logs/
# Output of Document1_Workflow.ipynb. It is a re-run of the setup document,
# not delivered evidence; the delivered copy is experiments/document1/.
/experiments/document1_workflow/
